    "created_at": "2017-06-05T13:05:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-05T13:05:12Z",
    "body": "`[class=\"foo\"]` does not match against the concept class. It matches against an attribute with the name \"class\".\r\n\r\nThat this was a source of confusion in an implementation means it's good to clarify; I just think the current state of this PR is not actually clarifying since it's confusing matters in a different way. :-)",
